    "text": "By WALA Digital Staff ,\n11 hours ago MOBILE, Ala. (WALA) - Mobile police are looking for the suspect who fired gunshots into two apartment units at Knollwood Apartments. Police said they were called Tuesday morning just after 1:30 a.m. for reports of shots fired. When officers arrived they canvassed the area but couldn’t find anything. MPD... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
